  unitName: Llewxam Weaver of Fate (EU)
  unitId: 750136
  unitNumber: 7147
  description: "I see the threads of everyone\u2019s fate. Past, present, future,
    living, dead, everything that is and was alive is in peril. The Corruption is
    spreading across time and space, and like myself, the immobile and divine being,
    Yggdrasil, grants the heralds its power via the portals of the constellations.
    The confrontation is close and inevitable."
  summonDesc: New powers awaken. Not only these.
  fusionDesc: I will use brand new powers to fight against the Corruption.
  evoDesc: I will guide many heroes to fight against the Corruption.
